            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **Regenerating the pairing code or turning iPhone alerts off now also stops
  a notification Perch was about to retry.** When the push service was briefly
  busy or the network dropped, Perch tried again a few seconds later — and
  that retry still went to a phone you had just unpaired or switched off. Now
  every retry checks first, and `push.log` says why one was cancelled.
]]></description>
